WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:00,980
Become a cow or a horse

2
00:00:00,980 --> 00:00:02,100
At least there is meat to eat

3
00:00:02,340 --> 00:00:03,540
You stand and make sarcastic remarks

4
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:09,650
Will the food come by itself? I'm going to Bei Slope.

5
00:00:13,630 --> 00:00:14,830
This is the chance

6
00:00:15,460 --> 00:00:16,580
Not enough things to bring

7
00:00:16,580 --> 00:00:18,180
Next time, your name won’t be on the sign.

8
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:20,100
Just wait and order the goods.

9
00:00:21,570 --> 00:00:22,610
You don't have to go to the highlands

10
00:00:23,170 --> 00:00:25,450
Today I went to the salt field to make two frames of stones

11
00:00:42,830 --> 00:00:46,340
Is there any difference?

12
00:00:47,010 --> 00:00:48,530
Today’s centimeters have been recorded

13
00:00:48,890 --> 00:00:49,970
Tomorrow it will still be two frames

14
00:00:50,090 --> 00:00:51,530
Co-authored by Let Me Move a Stone in a Day

15
00:00:52,170 --> 00:00:55,250
In the end, you can't even drink the salty soup.

16
00:00:55,610 --> 00:00:57,050
Move a frame of stones and get together

17
00:00:57,410 --> 00:00:59,410
If you are brave enough, I will change your words

18
00:00:59,730 --> 00:01:01,170
Then I have to save until the red year.

19
00:01:06,530 --> 00:01:07,770
Work with Teacher Jiang

20
00:01:07,850 --> 00:01:09,170
My hands are more valuable than before

21
00:01:10,730 --> 00:01:12,530
I am doing the work assigned by Teacher Jiang

22
00:01:12,970 --> 00:01:17,340
If you have something to say to him, life is not over yet.

23
00:01:17,460 --> 00:01:18,860
Load the stones into the slot machine for testing

24
00:01:18,860 --> 00:01:19,820
Don't block it here

25
00:01:21,620 --> 00:01:23,100
Director Quan wants to eat something salty

26
00:01:23,100 --> 00:01:24,220
It all depends on your face

27
00:01:24,540 --> 00:01:27,740
That's a really good thing. I don't look at people, I only look at accounts.

28
00:01:28,660 --> 00:01:30,620
Whoever makes a calculation has everything in his account

29
00:01:31,020 --> 00:01:34,690
You can pressure me with your accounts

30
00:01:34,690 --> 00:01:35,690
Isn’t it just centimeters?

31
00:01:35,690 --> 00:01:36,850
I'll just save it.
